<title>AUSTRIA: CA tender decision open, talks continue.</title>
<headline>CA tender decision open, talks continue.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Finance Minister Viktor Klima and Economy Minister Johann Farnleitner were in talks on Friday to hammer out a deal on the sale of Creditanstalt, but it was unclear whether they would find common ground.</p>
<p>Austrian radio earlier reported an announcement was imminent on the sale of the nation's second biggest bank.</p>
<p>&quot;Farnleitner held talks with Klima this morning and they agreed to talk again later today...But I cannot say what the outcome will be,&quot; an economy ministry spokesman said.</p>
</text>
